WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:13.474
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Can I help you?

2
00:00:13.778 --> 00:00:15.533
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Carla.

3
00:00:22.699 --> 00:00:25.444
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Hey, Ben. What would you like?

4
00:00:26.144 --> 00:00:28.466
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can I have an espresso, please?

5
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.137
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Single or double?

6
00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:43.287
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Double. And a brownie, please.

7
00:00:51.047 --> 00:00:55.481
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> OK. Anything else?

8
00:00:55.705 --> 00:00:58.859
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can I have a latte, please? With oat milk.

9
00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:09.892
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Regular or large?

10
00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:10.895
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Large.

11
00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:20.107
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> To have here or take away?

12
00:01:20.186 --> 00:01:21.347
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> To take away.

13
00:01:28.566 --> 00:01:29.411
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> OK.

14
00:01:30.202 --> 00:01:32.261
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> How much is that?

15
00:01:39.322 --> 00:01:43.466
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> That’s twelve pounds forty-five, please.

16
00:01:45.999 --> 00:01:49.219
Thank you. Do you want a receipt?

17
00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.579
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No. Thank you.